**styles.css:**
```css
@import '~@angular/material/prebuilt-themes/indigo-pink.css';
```

### Summary

By following these steps, you can simplify your Angular application by relying on standalone components and removing the need for a root `AppModule`. This modern approach can make your application more modular and easier to manage.

