Here’s how you can set up CKEditor in your Angular application to allow embedding HTML content directly, which includes images:

### 1. Install CKEditor

First, install CKEditor in your Angular project:

```bash
npm install --save @ckeditor/ckeditor5-angular @ckeditor/ckeditor5-build-classic
```

### 2. Configure CKEditor

Set up CKEditor in your Angular module:

