### 5. Firestore Security Rules

Ensure you have appropriate Firestore security rules in place:

```plaintext
rules_version = '2';
service cloud.firestore {
  match /databases/{database}/documents {
    match /institutes/{instituteId}/newsEvents/{newsEventId} {
      allow read: if true;
      allow write: if request.auth != null && request.auth.token.role == 'admin';
