To differentiate content based on subdomains, you need to read the subdomain from the URL in your Angular application.

#### Step 1: Get the Subdomain in Angular

Create a service to extract the subdomain:

```typescript
import { Injectable } from '@angular/core';

@Injectable({
  providedIn: 'root'
})
export class SubdomainService {
  constructor() { }

  getSubdomain(): string {
    const hostname = window.location.hostname;
    const parts = hostname.split('.');
    if (parts.length > 2) {
      return parts[0];
    }
    return '';
  }
}
